# === Design-system scratch (AI-generated mockup specs, not consumer-facing) ===
# The actual living design system lives inside packages/terminal/ — Tailwind v4
# CSS variables, shadcn/ui components, the three cinematic themes, and Glass
# Adaptive utilities. The standalone /design-system/ folder is a scratchpad
# for AI-generated design-rule outputs and should not ship with the public repo.
/design-system/

# === Agent-internal context (machine-local; scaffold via scripts/setup-agent-context.sh) ===
# CLAUDE.md / AGENTS.md / PLAN.md no longer ship with the public repo. They
# remain useful for personal coding-agent workflows but are kept out of
# tracking. Templates live at templates/agent-context/ and the script writes
# them to .local/agent-context/ for local use.
/CLAUDE.md
/AGENTS.md
/PLAN.md
/packages/*/CLAUDE.md
/packages/*/AGENTS.md

